      "value": "I use VR and I get the question all the time. I'm always wondering if they can't see my hands moving.. This would be a great addition. To my knowledge, knowing someone has VR or not doesn't break the fun and you can deduce if someone has one by looking at their avatar. This would make the annoying and repeating question dissapear. Perhaps a poll could be held to ask VR users whether they would like to show their specific hardware as additional tag in their name.",
      "viewerReactions": null
